guide forever/class/warlock/impsys-request
title An Imp's Request
category Class
class Warlock
folder Warlock
levels 50-54
zone Felwood
keywords An Imp's Request, Hot and Itchy, The Wrong Stuff, Trolls of a Feather, Impsy, Felcloth, Rotting Wood, Bloodvenom Essence, Voodoo Feather, Sunken Temple, Temple of Atal'Hakkar, Soul Harvester, Abyss Shard, Robes of Servitude, Warlock, class quest
reward item 20536 20534 20530
why A staff, off-hand or robe for your 50s; Impsy's own errand, not a step of the Dreadsteed chain.

# The level 52 Warlock class chain: An Imp's Request (8419) from your class
# trainer to Impsy in Felwood, The Wrong Stuff (8421) and Trolls of a Feather
# (8422), the Voodoo Feathers of the Sunken Temple's troll guardians.
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json and items.json (Questie 12.1.0 and
# Questie-Forever) for the givers, drops and spawns; Forever's
# Warlock class quest list (data/local/quest-audit/):
# unchanged in Forever, Trolls of a Feather lets you choose the Soul
# Harvester, the Abyss Shard or the Robes of Servitude.
# Impsy also offers Hot and Itchy (8420), the same Felcloth errand without the
# trainer; the two exclude each other, so take An Imp's Request from your
# trainer as below.
# The feathers drop from elite trolls inside the Sunken Temple: this chain
# needs a dungeon group. The classic quest data
# (quest 8422) asks for six feathers in all. The data has
# no position for the trolls or the dungeon entrance; the entrance point
# (69,54, the temple in the middle of the Pool of Tears) is from players' reports on
# the Sunken Temple zone (zone 1477).
# Not part of the Dreadsteed chain: An Imp's Request (8419 or 8420) -> The
# Wrong Stuff (8421) -> Trolls of a Feather (8422) ends there (8422 has no
# `next`, and no Dreadsteed quest needs any of them; the quest data's series for
# 8419 shows the same four). The imp of the Dreadsteed road is J'eevee in
# the Scholomance (Imp Delivery), not Impsy. Impsy's camp also runs Niby the
# Almighty's chain for the Shard of the Green Flame
# (forever/class/warlock/shard-of-the-green-flame), at the same spot.
# Based on data, not play: the beta caps at level 30 until launch on
# 4 November, so nothing here has been checked in game.

step An Imp's Request (Stormwind)
  only Human
  zone Stormwind City
  tip At 50 Demisette Cloyce in the Slaughtered Lamb, in the Mage Quarter, sends you to Impsy in Felwood.
  level 50
  accept 8419 npc 461                 -- Demisette Cloyce

step An Imp's Request (Ironforge)
  only Gnome
  zone Ironforge
  tip At 50 Briarthorn in Ironforge sends you to Impsy in Felwood.
  level 50
  accept 8419 npc 5172                -- Briarthorn

step An Imp's Request (Orgrimmar)
  only Orc,Troll
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip At 50 Zevrost in the Cleft of Shadow sends you to Impsy in Felwood.
  level 50
  accept 8419 npc 3326                -- Zevrost

step An Imp's Request (Undercity)
  only Undead
  zone Undercity
  tip At 50 Kaal Soulreaper in the Magic Quarter sends you to Impsy in Felwood.
  level 50
  accept 8419 npc 4563                -- Kaal Soulreaper

step Felcloth
  zone Felwood
  tip Impsy wants one Felcloth: the Jadefire satyrs and the demons of Jaedenar drop it.
  collect 14256 quest 8419.1          -- Felcloth

step Impsy
  tip Impsy waits beside Niby the Almighty in central Felwood, just east of Jaedenar. This chain is Impsy's own and is not part of the Dreadsteed chain; Niby and Impsy also give the Shard of the Green Flame chain here.
  turnin 8419                         -- Impsy
  accept 8421

step Rotting Wood and Bloodvenom
  tip The Irontree treants in northern Felwood drop the Rotting Wood; the Tainted Oozes around Jaedenar the Bloodvenom Essence.
  collect 20613 quest 8421.1          -- Rotting Wood
  collect 20614 quest 8421.2          -- Bloodvenom Essence

step Impsy again
  turnin 8421                         -- Impsy
  accept 8422

step The Sunken Temple
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  tip The six troll guardians of the Sunken Temple, a level 50 dungeon, each drop a Voodoo Feather: bring a group of five. The temple stands in the middle of the Pool of Tears; swim down into it to reach the entrance.
  collect 20606 quest 8422.1 @69.0,54.0 -- Amber Voodoo Feather
  collect 20607 quest 8422.2 @69.0,54.0 -- Blue Voodoo Feather
  collect 20608 quest 8422.3 @69.0,54.0 -- Green Voodoo Feather

step Trolls of a Feather
  zone Felwood
  turnin 8422 choose 20536 20534 20530 -- Impsy
